meta {
  name: Auth
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  GoTrue signup/login for the three seeded V1 roles (organizer/admin, participant, grader — T4's profiles-mirror trigger backfills public.profiles for each on signup). Run the three "Sign Up" requests first on a fresh database; on a re-run against an already-seeded database, use "Log In" instead (Sign Up returns 422/400 for an existing email). Every request downstream authenticates with the JWTs captured here.
}
